<%# app/views/__KEY__/dashboard/home.html.erb
    The app's front door — a slideshow, matching every other sub-app. The
    layout swaps the page body for :image, so this view is the slideshow and
    nothing else.

    It starts on Paperboy's own pictures. To give __LABEL__ its own, drop three
    images in app/assets/images/__KEY__/ named slide_01.png, slide_02.png and
    slide_03.png, add a __KEY___home_images method to
    app/helpers/slideshow_helper.rb alongside the others, and render that
    instead of paperboy_home_images. %>
<% content_for :image do %>
  <%= render "shared/slideshow", images: paperboy_home_images %>
<% end %>
